  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Goverment led health systems that save lives, more specifically:1. Increased utilisation and quality of health services, with emphasis on maternal and child health.2. Empowered communities that take charge of their own health.3. Improved institutional functioning, including governance and health system effectiveness, efficiency and equity.3. Effectively managed HPF mechanism.</narrative>
  </description>
